OL,3,GNEWSAFestivalgoers brave heavy rain on
OL,4,Awet first day
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have braved
OL,7,Fheavy rain as they arrived at the
OL,8,FReading Festival on its first day.
OL,10,FAbout 100,000 people are expected to
OL,11,Fsee acts including Charli xcx, Raye,
OL,12,FChase & Status, Dave and Fontaines D.C.
OL,13,Fahead of the annual event closing on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FRain is expected on all three days but
OL,17,FMonday, when most attendees are
OL,18,Fexpected to leave, is forecast to be
OL,19,Fdrier.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
